# Production stack environment — KEY NAMES ONLY, no values.
#
# The live file is /opt/baalvion/stack/.env on baalvion-prod and is NOT in this repo and must
# never be. This template exists so the SHAPE of the environment is reviewable and so a rebuild
# of the box does not depend on one operator remembering 119 variable names.
#
# Captured from the running stack 2026-09-09. If you add a variable there, add its name here.

